 but the DEFINITION may not. LANGUAGE.md states that rule outright - "the
 same defined-earlier rule that orders one file orders the pair - every use
 below stands after the definition it names" - so this is a rejection, and
 the message now says which line to move instead of complaining about the
 field name.)

